{"meta":{"id":"type-check","category":"it/syntax/python/compile","title":"타입 검사 (mypy · pydantic) · Python","subtitle":"(PYTHON)","summary":"타입 힌트는 실행 중 무시 — mypy / pyright 정적 검사, pydantic 런타임 검증","tags":["python","f-compile","f-runtime"],"color":"rose","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-rose","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-rose-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-rose-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-rose-50 text-rose-700 border border-rose-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></span>PYTHON</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">타입 검사 (mypy · pydantic) · Python</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-rose-50/70 border border-rose-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-rose-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> 타입 힌트는 실행 중 무시 — mypy / pyright 정적 검사, pydantic 런타임 검증</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">타입 힌트는 실행 시 검사되지 않는다</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">python</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">def add(a: int, b: int) -&gt; int:\r\n    return a + b\r\n\r\nadd(&quot;a&quot;, &quot;b&quot;)      # 실행 결과 &quot;ab&quot; — 오류 없음</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">정적 검사 (mypy · pyright) — 컴파일 시점 대응</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">bash</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">$ mypy app/\r\napp/main.py:4: error: Argument 1 to &quot;add&quot; has incompatible type &quot;str&quot;; expected &quot;int&quot;</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">TypeScript 의 tsc --noEmit 처럼 실행 전에 타입만 검사한다. VS Code(Pylance) 는 pyright 사용</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">실행 시점 검사가 필요할 때</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">python</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">from pydantic import BaseModel\r\n\r\nclass User(BaseModel):\r\n    id: int\r\n    name: str\r\n\r\nUser.model_validate({&quot;id&quot;: &quot;1&quot;, &quot;name&quot;: &quot;kim&quot;})   # id → 1 변환\r\nUser.model_validate({&quot;id&quot;: &quot;x&quot;})                  # ValidationError</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> TypeScript › 컴파일 시점에만 검사되는 제한, Java › 컴파일 vs 실행</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/python/compile/type-check","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"python","title":"PYTHON","path":"it/syntax/python"},{"id":"compile","title":"타입 검사","path":"it/syntax/python/compile"}],"hasImage":false}